And the 


sons of, 


the singers gathered together from the district surrounding Jerusalem and from the villages of the Netophathites;

and certain 


of the, 


priests’ sons with trumpets: Zechariah the son of Jonathan, son of Shemaiah, son of Mattaniah, son of Micaiah, son of Zaccur, son of Asaph;

So both 


choirs of, 


those who gave thanks stood in the house of God, and I and half of the officials with me;

and the 


priests Eliakim,, 


Maaseiah, Miniamin, Micaiah, Elioenai, Zechariah, and Hananiah, with trumpets;
